Lockdowns as Partial Holidays: dataset licence

1. Simulated data, derived regressors and results

   simulated/*, results/*, data/regressors_daily.csv, and the columns H, C, weekend, e_cn, bin_th and bin_cn of
   data/drivers_daily.csv
