2. Oxford COVID-19 Government Response Tracker

   data/raw/oxcgrt_si.csv and the columns s_th and s_cn of data/drivers_daily.csv
   Source: https://github.com/OxCGRT/covid-policy-dataset
   Licensed under CC BY 4.0 by the Blavatnik School of Government, University of Oxford.
   Cite: Hale, T. et al. (2021). A global panel database of pandemic policies (Oxford COVID-19 Government
   Response Tracker). Nature Human Behaviour, 5, 529-538.

3. Google COVID-19 Community Mobility Reports

   data/raw/gmob_thailand.csv and the columns workplaces_pct and hesi_th of data/drivers_daily.csv
   Source: Google LLC, via the mirror https://github.com/ActiveConclusion/COVID19_mobility
   These data remain under Google's terms of use. Attribute: Google LLC "Google COVID-19 Community Mobility
   Reports", https://www.google.com/covid19/mobility/
